        "candidate_id": "C_511cbaddc21f372e_2",
        "edit": "Invert the enable condition in the combinational always block: change `if(ena) y = 0;` to `if(!ena) y = 0;` so the decoder outputs the one-hot value when enabled and zero when disabled, matching the expected cycle-by-cycle behavior.",
